  sentences:
  - "Con \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng cho chuy\u1EBFn \u0111i xa h\u01A1n ch\u01B0a?
    Khu r\u1EEBng ph\xEDa b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i  L\xE0ng \u0111ang xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n
